      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THINKING OF YOU (8) goes very well this course and distance starting 10 times for seven wins and two minors. Placed last time (19.80) at this track in a Best 8, finishing third and beaten one length. Rates on top and should go close. BLACK AMETHYST (6) was a little disappointing last start at Murray Bridge Straight when 4th (16.85) over 300m. Great record here at the trip having never missed the frame including four wins. Key runner on best form. CULBURRA (2) boasts a strong record this journey here with three wins and two minors from six tries. Recorded a nose win (16.64) in a Grade 5 last time at Murray Bridge Straight. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. RIPPIN' PEDRO (4) racing over this distance brings the best out in him.",
